/Alt (Two flowcharts compare different cognitive task procedures. The left chart starts with "Adaptation 4 mins," followed by "Resting 3 mins," then "Mental arithmetic task 1 min," and ends. The right chart starts with "Adaptation 6 mins," followed by "Resting 3 mins," then "SIMKAP Cognitive Task 3 min," and ends. Arrows connect each step.)
/K [1230 0 R 1231 0 R 1232 0 R 1233 0 R 1234 0 R 1235 0 R 1236 0 R]
/P 40 0 R
