194 0 obj
<<
/Alt (Flowchart describing the signal processing steps: Decomposed signal \\\( x\(t\) \\\) is obtained. The Fourier spectrum of \\\( x\(t\) \\\) is calculated. Segment boundaries \\\( w_n \\\) are determined. ZFPB is constructed, and the signal is filtered by ZFPB. The filtered signal is converted back to the time domain using inverse Fourier transform, resulting in decomposed components \\\( x_n\(t\) \\\). These components are summed to reconstruct \\\( x\(t\) \\\).)
/K [1251 0 R 1252 0 R 1253 0 R 1254 0 R 1255 0 R 1256 0 R 1257 0 R]
/P 40 0 R
/S /Figure
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
